# Sub-tick extent of the gem glint (scripts/check_feeder_subtick.sh --path
# glint-ext). Rows: <bk2> | <V> | rec=<addr> [rtol=] [step=]. rec is the pool
# record whose extent is judged, a near star (24 traced corners) on its
# growing lifetime ramp.
#
# shady-oasis-flame.bk2 1324, rec 80067D00: canon1322 7.535 px, canon1324
# 8.524 px. Before the replay scaled the extent the alpha-0.5 ratio read 1.00
# SNAP with own 0.989 (the whole step); with the scale 0.04 LERPED, own 0.041.
# Bound rtol=0.25, the LERPED boundary, six times the measured reading.
shady-oasis-flame.bk2 | 1324 | rec=80067D00 rtol=0.25 step=0.5
